# Pulse of the Forge deals 4 to ai (20 -> 16); ai then has more life than
# human (10), so ReheatTheForge's ChangeZone | Defined$ Parent | Origin$ Stack
# returns the resolving spell to its owner's hand. Defined$ Parent is the root
# SpellAbility (AbilityUtils.java:1232-1233), moved off the stack by
# ChangeZoneEffect's spells-on-the-stack loop (ChangeZoneEffect.java:496-506,
# removeFromStack :1600-1624); the card never reaches the graveyard.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets ai
castspell human 1
resolvestack
